From the Marvelous Designer 2024 version, you can turn on multiple wind control devices.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Through this function, you can create a more diversified wind blowing environment.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Go to the display environment icon in the 3D window, click to display the wind control device.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
On the right-click on the wind control device icon, select copy, you can copy a wind control device.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:34,000
You can adjust the position of the copied wind control device, rotate and set the value according to your needs.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,000
After setting, record the animation and check the effect.

7
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Through multiple wind control devices, we simulated the animation effect of the jellyfish floating.

8
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,000
When creating a wind control device, open the wireless border to make it blow wind at an unlimited range.

9
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,000
If you close the wireless border, the wind blowing effect will only work within the range marked by the wind control device.

10
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,000
You can manually release the wind blowing function.

